- Call `/api/proxy?path=/your/endpoint`
- It forwards the request to `https://internal.example.com/api/proxy?path=/internal/path`
- It forwards the request with an Authorization header
- It forwards the response with a JSON body
- It gracefully handles upstream errors with a clear JSON response

