- Runs on every request except static assets.
- Checks if the request is for a production domain.
- If not production, redirects to https://.
- Otherwise, allows the request.

Usage notes:

- You can customize the matcher to include/exclude specific paths.
- For localhost development, you might want to skip the redirect.
- For production, configure your hosting (e.g., Vercel, Cloudflare, etc.) to set the x-forwarded-proto header.

